### List tariffs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tariffs
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a card payment
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: sample-order-1

{
  "tariff_id": "standard",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "method": "card",
  "promo_code": "KVITTO10"
}

###

### Filter payments
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/payments?email=student@example.com&status=pending
Accept: application/json